    "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 525.932993,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集，咱们从第十名讲到了第六名，北京香山靠的是京城老底子黄根红的像火焰。张家界的奇风泡在云海里，石柱忽隐忽现，庐山用雾和红叶搭出诗意。庐山把云海和彩云攒在一块儿，栖霞山拿古寺配红墙，金陵秋色全浓缩在那条山沟里。石处都是明白，名山大川、古寺、老城名气大，底子厚，可他们还不是最值得专程跑一趟的。接下来第五道第一名更厉害。有一座古村，把梯田、银杏和红枫画成了油画。有一片滩涂，在秋天变成光影海洋。有一条秦岭，山沟铺出百里彩林。有一片红叶染红长江两岸可排在榜首的那一处。整座火山天池泡在金黄色的林海里，他是哪里？他凭什么排在九寨沟前面茶给您续上了，点个关注，咱们接着往下讲。第五名，浙江临安指南村、杭州临安太湖园镇指南村。挂在海拔六百多米的山腰上，是华东地区最美古村落之一，村里有古树一百二十二株，主要是封箱银杏麻月深秋一道村口那口天池，把五彩秋色和粉墙古宅一起倒扣进水里，随手一按就是一张画。村子真正的底色是那几百亩梯田。十月下旬开始倒浪，一层层翻巾，银杏和蜂箱接着变色，黄红绿搅在一起，古朴民居点缀其间。村里有手工豆腐坊，能看着豆浆在点卤的瞬间变成豆腐，还有红叶咖啡端一杯，坐在田埂边，把整片金色喝下去。最佳赏期是十月下旬到十一月，一个藏在山腰里的老村子，把梯田、银杏、红枫和豆腐香攒在了一起。您说这是不是把日子过成了话？第四名明，福建霞浦、闽东海岸霞浦的秋天跟山里不一样，它是海上的秋天。每年秋天，北齐滩涂进入紫菜采收旺季，渔民在滩涂上擦干挂网，收紫菜，一根根竹竿在潮水褪去后露出来，排列成各种线条。清晨五点到七点，晨雾还没散，光线从海面上斜着照过来。滩涂上的水洼反着光渔民，您的影子拉的老长。傍晚四点到六点，落日柔光把整片滩涂染成金色，一片贪涂，汇聚万千光影，被摄影圈叫做朝圣之地。您要是站在岸边的高处往下看海的纹理，光的线条，人的影子全搅在一块儿，一片泥滩能变成一幅画。您说这是不是把苦日子过出了名堂？对了，我前阵子翻到一本叫三百六十五日走遍中国的日历书，左边一页是每个地方的实景大图，加一段五十来个字的知识，右边是日期计时夜，什么季节去哪座山，哪个月，看哪片林走哪条路，看什么风景最合适，都给你安排好了。不是那种千篇一律的景点介绍，是帮你挑日子。今天翻到巫山红叶，明天翻到二山临海，后天翻到霞浦滩图，翻到哪页，就觉得那个地方在喊你我自己的习惯是每天早起翻一页当个消遣，翻到一个从来没听说过的小地方，就去网上搜搜照片，搜完就想订票。我已经放下面了，点开就能看到。喜欢到处走走的朋友，弄一本放茶几。上一年下来，整个中国哪儿值得去，哪个乐器，心里全有谱了。第三名，陕西秦岭黄伯铎、宝鸡太白县、黄伯陀藏在秦岭深处，被叫做秦岭小九寨秦岭香格里拉、大涧沟一带的彩林贴着溪水生长。十月中下旬迎来颜值巅峰，太阳公路沿线全线换装秋日色彩红叶变色率从十月上旬的百分之十，一路涨到十月下旬的百分之九十五，沟里，铺着平缓栈道和观景台，徒步轻松自驾进沟山路蜿蜒镇上住宿有限旺季的提前定，您沿着溪水边的栈道慢慢走走。水是青的，叶子是红的，黄的，倒影在水面上晃来晃去，一条山沟把彩铃和溪水搭在一起。您说这是不是秦岭秋天压箱底的绝活？第二名，重庆巫山、长江三峡巫山拥有一百二十万亩红叶品种多达两百余个，是亚洲规模最大的红叶观赏圣地。每年十一、一月到次年一月，红叶剑刺染红，绵延长江，两岸观赏期长达三个月。高峡平湖蓄水之后，长江水面变宽了，两岸的红叶倒映在江水里，坐船从巫峡穿过，抬头是红叶山，低头是红叶水。核心观赏区覆盖无暇神女景区、小三峡等地。您站在沈女峰对岸往上看，整面山坡从江边一直红到山顶，船在江里，走山在两岸，红一百二十万亩红叶挂在长江两岸。您说这样的排场别处哪里找得到第一名？内蒙古阿尔山大兴安岭西南山路排第一的是二山，很多人只知道阿尔山是个边陲小城，不知道他的秋天才是真正压箱底的绝活。阿尔山地处大兴安岭西南山路，全年无双期只有约九十五天，是国内最早入秋的地方之一。每年九月中下旬到十月上旬，万顷临海如彩锦，铺展金黄火红墨绿交织，松涛阵阵，雾气氤氲。驼峰岭天池像一面天空之境，倒映着蓝天和金黄的凌海。石塘林的火山遗迹跟五彩丘陵形成强烈对比。黑色的火山岩上长着金黄的落叶松像，穿越到了另一个世界，不冻河，在零下的天气里照样流着。河面上冒着热气，两岸是金色的林子，一座火山天池，把林海泡在金子里。您说这样的地方凭什么不能排第一？从第十到第一名，香山靠的是京城老底子。张家界的骑风炮在云海里，庐山用雾和红叶搭出失意。黄山把云海和彩铃攒在一块儿。栖霞山拿古寺配红墙指南村，把梯田和银杏画成了油画峡浦，让贪涂变成了光影的画布。黄白塔在秦岭深处突出了百里彩铃。巫山用一百二十万亩红叶染红了长江两岸，可真正排在榜首的阿尔山用火山天池、金色林海和不动河的雾气，给中国秋日胜地画上了最浓的一笔。您心里头那个第一名跟这个排法对得上吗？点个关注，下回咱们接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00001",
      "start_ms": 190,
      "end_ms": 650,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00002",
      "start_ms": 650,
      "end_ms": 3150,
      "text": "咱们从第十名讲到了第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3550,
      "end_ms": 8550,
      "text": "北京香山靠的是京城老底子黄根红的像火焰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00004",
      "start_ms": 9170,
      "end_ms": 11850,
      "text": "张家界的奇风泡在云海里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00005",
      "start_ms": 12370,
      "end_ms": 14430,
      "text": "石柱忽隐忽现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00006",
      "start_ms": 15010,
      "end_ms": 17710,
      "text": "庐山用雾和红叶搭出诗意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00007",
      "start_ms": 18490,
      "end_ms": 21430,
      "text": "庐山把云海和彩云攒在一块儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00008",
      "start_ms": 21930,
      "end_ms": 23970,
      "text": "栖霞山拿古寺配红墙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00009",
      "start_ms": 24690,
      "end_ms": 27810,
      "text": "金陵秋色全浓缩在那条山沟里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00010",
      "start_ms": 28590,
      "end_ms": 30000,
      "text": "石处都是明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00011",
      "start_ms": 30060,
      "end_ms": 33820,
      "text": "名山大川、古寺、老城名气大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00012",
      "start_ms": 34000,
      "end_ms": 34660,
      "text": "底子厚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00013",
      "start_ms": 35080,
      "end_ms": 38420,
      "text": "可他们还不是最值得专程跑一趟的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00014",
      "start_ms": 38960,
      "end_ms": 41660,
      "text": "接下来第五道第一名更厉害。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00015",
      "start_ms": 41800,
      "end_ms": 42740,
      "text": "有一座古村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00016",
      "start_ms": 43040,
      "end_ms": 46860,
      "text": "把梯田、银杏和红枫画成了油画。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00017",
      "start_ms": 47480,
      "end_ms": 48960,
      "text": "有一片滩涂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00018",
      "start_ms": 48960,
      "end_ms": 51120,
      "text": "在秋天变成光影海洋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00019",
      "start_ms": 51580,
      "end_ms": 52660,
      "text": "有一条秦岭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00020",
      "start_ms": 52680,
      "end_ms": 54580,
      "text": "山沟铺出百里彩林。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00021",
      "start_ms": 55040,
      "end_ms": 60795,
      "text": "有一片红叶染红长江两岸可排在榜首的那一处。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00022",
      "start_ms": 61550,
      "end_ms": 64945,
      "text": "整座火山天池泡在金黄色的林海里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00023",
      "start_ms": 65820,
      "end_ms": 66585,
      "text": "他是哪里？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00024",
      "start_ms": 66850,
      "end_ms": 70235,
      "text": "他凭什么排在九寨沟前面茶给您续上了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00025",
      "start_ms": 70400,
      "end_ms": 71275,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00026",
      "start_ms": 71890,
      "end_ms": 72995,
      "text": "咱们接着往下讲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00027",
      "start_ms": 73360,
      "end_ms": 73935,
      "text": "第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00028",
      "start_ms": 75170,
      "end_ms": 80700,
      "text": "浙江临安指南村、杭州临安太湖园镇指南村。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00029",
      "start_ms": 80760,
      "end_ms": 83420,
      "text": "挂在海拔六百多米的山腰上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00030",
      "start_ms": 83480,
      "end_ms": 86305,
      "text": "是华东地区最美古村落之一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00031",
      "start_ms": 87120,
      "end_ms": 89505,
      "text": "村里有古树一百二十二株，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00032",
      "start_ms": 90290,
      "end_ms": 96270,
      "text": "主要是封箱银杏麻月深秋一道村口那口天池，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00033",
      "start_ms": 96270,
      "end_ms": 100465,
      "text": "把五彩秋色和粉墙古宅一起倒扣进水里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00034",
      "start_ms": 100910,
      "end_ms": 102845,
      "text": "随手一按就是一张画。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00035",
      "start_ms": 103780,
      "end_ms": 107055,
      "text": "村子真正的底色是那几百亩梯田。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00036",
      "start_ms": 107980,
      "end_ms": 109680,
      "text": "十月下旬开始倒浪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00037",
      "start_ms": 109860,
      "end_ms": 111065,
      "text": "一层层翻巾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00038",
      "start_ms": 111940,
      "end_ms": 114025,
      "text": "银杏和蜂箱接着变色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00039",
      "start_ms": 114780,
      "end_ms": 116385,
      "text": "黄红绿搅在一起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00040",
      "start_ms": 116800,
      "end_ms": 119325,
      "text": "古朴民居点缀其间。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00041",
      "start_ms": 120010,
      "end_ms": 122350,
      "text": "村里有手工豆腐坊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00042",
      "start_ms": 122830,
      "end_ms": 127150,
      "text": "能看着豆浆在点卤的瞬间变成豆腐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00043",
      "start_ms": 127230,
      "end_ms": 129410,
      "text": "还有红叶咖啡端一杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00044",
      "start_ms": 129490,
      "end_ms": 130610,
      "text": "坐在田埂边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00045",
      "start_ms": 131030,
      "end_ms": 133010,
      "text": "把整片金色喝下去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00046",
      "start_ms": 133910,
      "end_ms": 137790,
      "text": "最佳赏期是十月下旬到十一月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00047",
      "start_ms": 138570,
      "end_ms": 140970,
      "text": "一个藏在山腰里的老村子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00048",
      "start_ms": 141510,
      "end_ms": 145750,
      "text": "把梯田、银杏、红枫和豆腐香攒在了一起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00049",
      "start_ms": 146210,
      "end_ms": 148530,
      "text": "您说这是不是把日子过成了话？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00050",
      "start_ms": 149130,
      "end_ms": 150000,
      "text": "第四名明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00051",
      "start_ms": 150220,
      "end_ms": 155480,
      "text": "福建霞浦、闽东海岸霞浦的秋天跟山里不一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00052",
      "start_ms": 155940,
      "end_ms": 157400,
      "text": "它是海上的秋天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00053",
      "start_ms": 157879,
      "end_ms": 158760,
      "text": "每年秋天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00054",
      "start_ms": 158760,
      "end_ms": 161640,
      "text": "北齐滩涂进入紫菜采收旺季，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00055",
      "start_ms": 162080,
      "end_ms": 164520,
      "text": "渔民在滩涂上擦干挂网，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00056",
      "start_ms": 164600,
      "end_ms": 165300,
      "text": "收紫菜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00057",
      "start_ms": 165480,
      "end_ms": 168160,
      "text": "一根根竹竿在潮水褪去后露出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00058",
      "start_ms": 168220,
      "end_ms": 169600,
      "text": "排列成各种线条。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00059",
      "start_ms": 170560,
      "end_ms": 172100,
      "text": "清晨五点到七点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00060",
      "start_ms": 173020,
      "end_ms": 174020,
      "text": "晨雾还没散，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00061",
      "start_ms": 174300,
      "end_ms": 176540,
      "text": "光线从海面上斜着照过来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00062",
      "start_ms": 176900,
      "end_ms": 179600,
      "text": "滩涂上的水洼反着光渔民，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00063",
      "start_ms": 179750,
      "end_ms": 181075,
      "text": "您的影子拉的老长。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00064",
      "start_ms": 181590,
      "end_ms": 182895,
      "text": "傍晚四点到六点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00065",
      "start_ms": 183360,
      "end_ms": 187095,
      "text": "落日柔光把整片滩涂染成金色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00066",
      "start_ms": 187660,
      "end_ms": 188765,
      "text": "一片贪涂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00067",
      "start_ms": 189140,
      "end_ms": 190925,
      "text": "汇聚万千光影，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00068",
      "start_ms": 191670,
      "end_ms": 194135,
      "text": "被摄影圈叫做朝圣之地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00069",
      "start_ms": 194860,
      "end_ms": 198965,
      "text": "您要是站在岸边的高处往下看海的纹理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00070",
      "start_ms": 199220,
      "end_ms": 200100,
      "text": "光的线条，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00071",
      "start_ms": 200520,
      "end_ms": 202940,
      "text": "人的影子全搅在一块儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00072",
      "start_ms": 202940,
      "end_ms": 205615,
      "text": "一片泥滩能变成一幅画。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00073",
      "start_ms": 206400,
      "end_ms": 209545,
      "text": "您说这是不是把苦日子过出了名堂？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00074",
      "start_ms": 210340,
      "end_ms": 210755,
      "text": "对了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00075",
      "start_ms": 211690,
      "end_ms": 217025,
      "text": "我前阵子翻到一本叫三百六十五日走遍中国的日历书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00076",
      "start_ms": 217600,
      "end_ms": 221105,
      "text": "左边一页是每个地方的实景大图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00077",
      "start_ms": 221570,
      "end_ms": 223845,
      "text": "加一段五十来个字的知识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00078",
      "start_ms": 224380,
      "end_ms": 226015,
      "text": "右边是日期计时夜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00079",
      "start_ms": 226580,
      "end_ms": 228245,
      "text": "什么季节去哪座山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00080",
      "start_ms": 228610,
      "end_ms": 228990,
      "text": "哪个月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00081",
      "start_ms": 228990,
      "end_ms": 231060,
      "text": "看哪片林走哪条路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00082",
      "start_ms": 231060,
      "end_ms": 232575,
      "text": "看什么风景最合适，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00083",
      "start_ms": 232840,
      "end_ms": 233985,
      "text": "都给你安排好了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00084",
      "start_ms": 234910,
      "end_ms": 237435,
      "text": "不是那种千篇一律的景点介绍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00085",
      "start_ms": 237780,
      "end_ms": 239045,
      "text": "是帮你挑日子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00086",
      "start_ms": 239240,
      "end_ms": 240845,
      "text": "今天翻到巫山红叶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00087",
      "start_ms": 241190,
      "end_ms": 242950,
      "text": "明天翻到二山临海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00088",
      "start_ms": 243170,
      "end_ms": 245094,
      "text": "后天翻到霞浦滩图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00089",
      "start_ms": 245680,
      "end_ms": 246520,
      "text": "翻到哪页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00090",
      "start_ms": 246600,
      "end_ms": 253385,
      "text": "就觉得那个地方在喊你我自己的习惯是每天早起翻一页当个消遣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00091",
      "start_ms": 253850,
      "end_ms": 257015,
      "text": "翻到一个从来没听说过的小地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00092",
      "start_ms": 257370,
      "end_ms": 259055,
      "text": "就去网上搜搜照片，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00093",
      "start_ms": 259560,
      "end_ms": 260995,
      "text": "搜完就想订票。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00094",
      "start_ms": 261360,
      "end_ms": 262625,
      "text": "我已经放下面了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00095",
      "start_ms": 262950,
      "end_ms": 264195,
      "text": "点开就能看到。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00096",
      "start_ms": 264550,
      "end_ms": 266225,
      "text": "喜欢到处走走的朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00097",
      "start_ms": 266490,
      "end_ms": 267610,
      "text": "弄一本放茶几。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00098",
      "start_ms": 267610,
      "end_ms": 269585,
      "text": "上一年下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00099",
      "start_ms": 270060,
      "end_ms": 271800,
      "text": "整个中国哪儿值得去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00100",
      "start_ms": 271800,
      "end_ms": 272615,
      "text": "哪个乐器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00101",
      "start_ms": 273010,
      "end_ms": 274235,
      "text": "心里全有谱了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00102",
      "start_ms": 274380,
      "end_ms": 275005,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00103",
      "start_ms": 275460,
      "end_ms": 284010,
      "text": "陕西秦岭黄伯铎、宝鸡太白县、黄伯陀藏在秦岭深处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00104",
      "start_ms": 284210,
      "end_ms": 292235,
      "text": "被叫做秦岭小九寨秦岭香格里拉、大涧沟一带的彩林贴着溪水生长。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00105",
      "start_ms": 292670,
      "end_ms": 295230,
      "text": "十月中下旬迎来颜值巅峰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00106",
      "start_ms": 295790,
      "end_ms": 302650,
      "text": "太阳公路沿线全线换装秋日色彩红叶变色率从十月上旬的百分之十，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00107",
      "start_ms": 303190,
      "end_ms": 306290,
      "text": "一路涨到十月下旬的百分之九十五，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00108",
      "start_ms": 306770,
      "end_ms": 307310,
      "text": "沟里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00109",
      "start_ms": 307350,
      "end_ms": 310850,
      "text": "铺着平缓栈道和观景台，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00110",
      "start_ms": 311470,
      "end_ms": 319050,
      "text": "徒步轻松自驾进沟山路蜿蜒镇上住宿有限旺季的提前定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00111",
      "start_ms": 319610,
      "end_ms": 322800,
      "text": "您沿着溪水边的栈道慢慢走走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00112",
      "start_ms": 323180,
      "end_ms": 324280,
      "text": "水是青的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00113",
      "start_ms": 324460,
      "end_ms": 325660,
      "text": "叶子是红的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00114",
      "start_ms": 325760,
      "end_ms": 326320,
      "text": "黄的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00115",
      "start_ms": 326680,
      "end_ms": 329080,
      "text": "倒影在水面上晃来晃去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00116",
      "start_ms": 329520,
      "end_ms": 332780,
      "text": "一条山沟把彩铃和溪水搭在一起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00117",
      "start_ms": 333300,
      "end_ms": 336680,
      "text": "您说这是不是秦岭秋天压箱底的绝活？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00118",
      "start_ms": 337860,
      "end_ms": 338520,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00119",
      "start_ms": 339040,
      "end_ms": 347140,
      "text": "重庆巫山、长江三峡巫山拥有一百二十万亩红叶品种多达两百余个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00120",
      "start_ms": 347540,
      "end_ms": 351040,
      "text": "是亚洲规模最大的红叶观赏圣地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00121",
      "start_ms": 351700,
      "end_ms": 354165,
      "text": "每年十一、一月到次年一月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00122",
      "start_ms": 354550,
      "end_ms": 356575,
      "text": "红叶剑刺染红，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00123",
      "start_ms": 357020,
      "end_ms": 358240,
      "text": "绵延长江，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00124",
      "start_ms": 358300,
      "end_ms": 360695,
      "text": "两岸观赏期长达三个月。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00125",
      "start_ms": 361230,
      "end_ms": 362770,
      "text": "高峡平湖蓄水之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00126",
      "start_ms": 362990,
      "end_ms": 364555,
      "text": "长江水面变宽了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00127",
      "start_ms": 365150,
      "end_ms": 367635,
      "text": "两岸的红叶倒映在江水里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00128",
      "start_ms": 368310,
      "end_ms": 370615,
      "text": "坐船从巫峡穿过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00129",
      "start_ms": 371040,
      "end_ms": 372445,
      "text": "抬头是红叶山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00130",
      "start_ms": 372950,
      "end_ms": 374795,
      "text": "低头是红叶水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00131",
      "start_ms": 375270,
      "end_ms": 379885,
      "text": "核心观赏区覆盖无暇神女景区、小三峡等地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00132",
      "start_ms": 380500,
      "end_ms": 382985,
      "text": "您站在沈女峰对岸往上看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00133",
      "start_ms": 383730,
      "end_ms": 387345,
      "text": "整面山坡从江边一直红到山顶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00134",
      "start_ms": 387820,
      "end_ms": 388880,
      "text": "船在江里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00135",
      "start_ms": 388880,
      "end_ms": 390590,
      "text": "走山在两岸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00136",
      "start_ms": 390590,
      "end_ms": 394975,
      "text": "红一百二十万亩红叶挂在长江两岸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00137",
      "start_ms": 395670,
      "end_ms": 399440,
      "text": "您说这样的排场别处哪里找得到第一名？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00138",
      "start_ms": 399520,
      "end_ms": 405365,
      "text": "内蒙古阿尔山大兴安岭西南山路排第一的是二山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00139",
      "start_ms": 406280,
      "end_ms": 409205,
      "text": "很多人只知道阿尔山是个边陲小城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00140",
      "start_ms": 409630,
      "end_ms": 413185,
      "text": "不知道他的秋天才是真正压箱底的绝活。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00141",
      "start_ms": 413860,
      "end_ms": 416585,
      "text": "阿尔山地处大兴安岭西南山路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00142",
      "start_ms": 417050,
      "end_ms": 419435,
      "text": "全年无双期只有约九十五天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00143",
      "start_ms": 420020,
      "end_ms": 423115,
      "text": "是国内最早入秋的地方之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00144",
      "start_ms": 423810,
      "end_ms": 426365,
      "text": "每年九月中下旬到十月上旬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00145",
      "start_ms": 426870,
      "end_ms": 429240,
      "text": "万顷临海如彩锦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00146",
      "start_ms": 429260,
      "end_ms": 433345,
      "text": "铺展金黄火红墨绿交织，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00147",
      "start_ms": 433730,
      "end_ms": 434805,
      "text": "松涛阵阵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00148",
      "start_ms": 435340,
      "end_ms": 436445,
      "text": "雾气氤氲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00149",
      "start_ms": 437000,
      "end_ms": 440690,
      "text": "驼峰岭天池像一面天空之境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00150",
      "start_ms": 440730,
      "end_ms": 443445,
      "text": "倒映着蓝天和金黄的凌海。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00151",
      "start_ms": 444370,
      "end_ms": 448525,
      "text": "石塘林的火山遗迹跟五彩丘陵形成强烈对比。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00152",
      "start_ms": 449380,
      "end_ms": 454260,
      "text": "黑色的火山岩上长着金黄的落叶松像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00153",
      "start_ms": 454300,
      "end_ms": 455845,
      "text": "穿越到了另一个世界，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00154",
      "start_ms": 456440,
      "end_ms": 456960,
      "text": "不冻河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00155",
      "start_ms": 456960,
      "end_ms": 459055,
      "text": "在零下的天气里照样流着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00156",
      "start_ms": 459990,
      "end_ms": 461535,
      "text": "河面上冒着热气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00157",
      "start_ms": 462160,
      "end_ms": 463835,
      "text": "两岸是金色的林子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00158",
      "start_ms": 464660,
      "end_ms": 465840,
      "text": "一座火山天池，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00159",
      "start_ms": 465840,
      "end_ms": 467445,
      "text": "把林海泡在金子里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00160",
      "start_ms": 468350,
      "end_ms": 471295,
      "text": "您说这样的地方凭什么不能排第一？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00161",
      "start_ms": 471730,
      "end_ms": 473705,
      "text": "从第十到第一名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00162",
      "start_ms": 474130,
      "end_ms": 476315,
      "text": "香山靠的是京城老底子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00163",
      "start_ms": 476830,
      "end_ms": 479730,
      "text": "张家界的骑风炮在云海里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00164",
      "start_ms": 479730,
      "end_ms": 482445,
      "text": "庐山用雾和红叶搭出失意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00165",
      "start_ms": 483030,
      "end_ms": 485965,
      "text": "黄山把云海和彩铃攒在一块儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00166",
      "start_ms": 486430,
      "end_ms": 489730,
      "text": "栖霞山拿古寺配红墙指南村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00167",
      "start_ms": 489730,
      "end_ms": 493640,
      "text": "把梯田和银杏画成了油画峡浦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00168",
      "start_ms": 493640,
      "end_ms": 496495,
      "text": "让贪涂变成了光影的画布。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00169",
      "start_ms": 497100,
      "end_ms": 501035,
      "text": "黄白塔在秦岭深处突出了百里彩铃。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00170",
      "start_ms": 501680,
      "end_ms": 506115,
      "text": "巫山用一百二十万亩红叶染红了长江两岸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00171",
      "start_ms": 506590,
      "end_ms": 513645,
      "text": "可真正排在榜首的阿尔山用火山天池、金色林海和不动河的雾气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00172",
      "start_ms": 514170,
      "end_ms": 517955,
      "text": "给中国秋日胜地画上了最浓的一笔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00173",
      "start_ms": 518950,
      "end_ms": 522185,
      "text": "您心里头那个第一名跟这个排法对得上吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00174",
      "start_ms": 522360,
      "end_ms": 523055,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e2e204dd2bba93f2_s00175",
      "start_ms": 524030,
      "end_ms": 525815,
      "text": "下回咱们接着聊。"
    }
  ],
